.SH NAME
buf-dep-update - Update pinned module dependencies in a buf.lock


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbuf dep update  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Fetch the latest digests for the specified module references in buf.yaml,
and write them and their transitive dependencies to buf.lock.

.PP
The first argument is the directory of the local module to update.
Defaults to "." if no argument is specified.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for update


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Turn on debug logging

.PP
\fB--log-format\fP="color"
	The log format [text,color,json]

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	The duration until timing out, setting it to 0 means no timeout


